{"key": "PRJ-049386089F", "metadata": {"account_sk": "SYN-42-01", "country": "Colombia", "crop": "coffee", "entity_type": "smallholder", "load_id": "ba46e96f6936", "name": "Rainwater reservoirs", "org_name_fictional": "Finca Nueva Esperanza (fictional)", "primary_tag": "water", "region": "Huila", "start_year": 2023, "status": "completed", "text_sha1": "2a9c5f3fa518e3cffe96348cc953bc0d66f079fb"}, "text": "Rainwater reservoirs Built rainwater harvesting reservoirs and drip irrigation for member plots after two dry seasons reduced coffee yields. Unreliable rainfall and water shortages during flowering."}
{"key": "PRJ-7FABAADD92", "metadata": {"account_sk": "SYN-42-01-PA", "country": "Colombia", "crop": "coffee", "entity_type": "smallholder", "load_id": "ba46e96f6936", "name": "Shade trees for moisture retention", "org_name_fictional": "Finca Flor del Campo (fictional)", "primary_tag": "climate_weather", "region": "Huila", "start_year": 2023, "status": "completed", "text_sha1": "e2ecde57b8e74bfb050ff2b875401a6c661377c0"}, "text": "Shade trees for moisture retention Planted native shade trees and mulched coffee plots to keep soil moisture during longer dry spells. Longer dry periods and higher temperatures stressing coffee plants."}
{"key": "PRJ-D1057D3B13", "metadata": {"account_sk": "SYN-42-01-PB", "country": "Colombia", "crop": "coffee", "entity_type": "cooperative", "load_id": "ba46e96f6936", "name": "Community water tanks", "org_name_fictional": "Cooperativa Las Palmas (fictional)", "primary_tag": "water", "region": "Cauca", "start_year": 2023, "status": "completed", "text_sha1": "77200b22e39eeb6782a92a74322c9f73ae71b72f"}, "text": "Community water tanks Installed shared water storage tanks and repaired spring catchments serving 120 member households. Springs drying up in the dry season."}
{"key": "PRJ-B97BD02E8E", "metadata": {"account_sk": "SYN-42-02", "country": "Peru", "crop": "coffee", "entity_type": "cooperative", "load_id": "ba46e96f6936", "name": "Organic fertilizer plant", "org_name_fictional": "Cooperativa El Roble (fictional)", "primary_tag": "soil_land", "region": "Cajamarca", "start_year": 2023, "status": "completed", "text_sha1": "9fb857d4ff4b9c5c4bb03774f108471549a6fdb0"}, "text": "Organic fertilizer plant Set up a compost and bio-fertilizer production unit so members can restore soil organic matter on depleted coffee plots. Declining soil fertility and rising fertilizer costs."}
{"key": "PRJ-FED7432304", "metadata": {"account_sk": "SYN-42-02-PA", "country": "Peru", "crop": "coffee", "entity_type": "cooperative", "load_id": "ba46e96f6936", "name": "Coffee rust management program", "org_name_fictional": "Cooperativa Agua Dulce 3 (fictional)", "primary_tag": "soil_land", "region": "Cajamarca", "start_year": 2023, "status": "completed", "text_sha1": "57182cd1815a35971250cf2d8d8e8a6f1c5e2bb3"}, "text": "Coffee rust management program Renovated plots with rust-resistant varieties and trained members in integrated pest management. Coffee leaf rust outbreaks after wetter seasons."}
{"key": "PRJ-A087BAA67D", "metadata": {"account_sk": "SYN-42-02-PB", "country": "Peru", "crop": "coffee", "entity_type": "smallholder", "load_id": "ba46e96f6936", "name": "Erosion control terraces", "org_name_fictional": "Finca Río Claro (fictional)", "primary_tag": "soil_land", "region": "San Martin", "start_year": 2023, "status": "in_progress", "text_sha1": "e9d9b90f18528e960c124c857edb50505adf81eb"}, "text": "Erosion control terraces Built live barriers and terraces on steep coffee plots to reduce soil erosion during heavy rain. Soil loss on steep slopes."}
{"key": "PRJ-4982A7A470", "metadata": {"account_sk": "SYN-42-03", "country": "Mexico", "crop": "coffee", "entity_type": "cooperative", "load_id": "ba46e96f6936", "name": "Honey and allspice diversification", "org_name_fictional": "Cooperativa Cerro Verde (fictional)", "primary_tag": "market_price", "region": "Chiapas", "start_year": 2023, "status": "completed", "text_sha1": "fca562ccf6500e67f6be9292afdd2f89af0eea61"}, "text": "Honey and allspice diversification Supported members to add beekeeping and allspice as second income sources alongside coffee. Falling coffee prices and unstable income."}
{"key": "PRJ-46CBCD7EC2", "metadata": {"account_sk": "SYN-42-03-PA", "country": "Mexico", "crop": "coffee", "entity_type": "cooperative", "load_id": "ba46e96f6936", "name": "Quality cupping lab", "org_name_fictional": "Cooperativa Agua Dulce 2 (fictional)", "primary_tag": "market_price", "region": "Chiapas", "start_year": 2023, "status": "completed", "text_sha1": "f5fa0c2d34aaacb515efd905685ae26b20611687"}, "text": "Quality cupping lab Equipped a cupping lab so the cooperative can sort lots by quality and negotiate higher prices for specialty coffee. Low farm-gate prices for undifferentiated coffee."}
{"key": "PRJ-0F275FAF3A", "metadata": {"account_sk": "SYN-42-03-PB", "country": "Mexico", "crop": "coffee", "entity_type": "smallholder", "load_id": "ba46e96f6936", "name": "Revolving credit fund", "org_name_fictional": "Finca Alto Mayo (fictional)", "primary_tag": "financial_capital", "region": "Chiapas", "start_year": 2023, "status": "completed", "text_sha1": "4e0157d3a362f16f500bc528900a34056664b3a5"}, "text": "Revolving credit fund Created a revolving credit fund so members can cover harvest costs without selling early to intermediaries at low prices. Members forced to sell early at low prices to cover harvest costs."}
{"key": "PRJ-D8FDEF980D", "metadata": {"account_sk": "SYN-42-04", "country": "Honduras", "crop": "banana", "entity_type": "estate", "load_id": "ba46e96f6936", "name": "Worker housing improvements", "org_name_fictional": "Hacienda Los Pinos (fictional)", "primary_tag": "labor_migration", "region": "Copan", "start_year": 2023, "status": "completed", "text_sha1": "e7b347e0f4196473f66a3077956249d1237038f5"}, "text": "Worker housing improvements Improved housing and sanitation for seasonal workers to retain labor during harvest. Workers migrating to cities and abroad, causing labor shortages at harvest."}
{"key": "PRJ-E413456457", "metadata": {"account_sk": "SYN-42-04-PA", "country": "Honduras", "crop": "banana", "entity_type": "estate", "load_id": "ba46e96f6936", "name": "Childcare center for workers", "org_name_fictional": "Hacienda Alto Mayo (fictional)", "primary_tag": "social_community", "region": "Copan", "start_year": 2023, "status": "completed", "text_sha1": "4d166288e448ef642325edeb1da63bc8687d5b9f"}, "text": "Childcare center for workers Opened a childcare center so worker families, especially women, can keep working on the farm. Women workers leaving because there is no childcare."}
{"key": "PRJ-3411C16DBF", "metadata": {"account_sk": "SYN-42-04-PB", "country": "Honduras", "crop": "banana", "entity_type": "cooperative", "load_id": "ba46e96f6936", "name": "Youth agricultural training", "org_name_fictional": "Cooperativa Agua Dulce (fictional)", "primary_tag": "education", "region": "Ocotepeque", "start_year": 2023, "status": "completed", "text_sha1": "eefc936d1a1a2b42c9f90335fb667d925bea3c34"}, "text": "Youth agricultural training Training program for young people in banana farm management to reduce youth migration. Young people migrating for lack of local work."}
{"key": "PRJ-19954FD930", "metadata": {"account_sk": "SYN-42-05", "country": "Côte d'Ivoire", "crop": "cocoa", "entity_type": "cooperative", "load_id": "ba46e96f6936", "name": "Cocoa agroforestry", "org_name_fictional": "Coopérative Nouvelle Terre (fictional)", "primary_tag": "climate_weather", "region": "Bas-Sassandra", "start_year": 2023, "status": "completed", "text_sha1": "ae7705c241ce8173ed6b8ef9e2ea759af835b177"}, "text": "Cocoa agroforestry Distributed native forest tree seedlings to plant in cocoa farms and mapped plots to avoid deforestation. Deforestation pressure and declining rainfall in cocoa areas."}
{"key": "PRJ-4E96A5F516", "metadata": {"account_sk": "SYN-42-05-PA", "country": "Côte d'Ivoire", "crop": "cocoa", "entity_type": "cooperative", "load_id": "ba46e96f6936", "name": "Forest boundary protection", "org_name_fictional": "Coopérative Lumière (fictional)", "primary_tag": "biodiversity_conservation", "region": "Bas-Sassandra", "start_year": 2023, "status": "completed", "text_sha1": "f1c068a55f97bd7d16f493266c4898030bbf6d94"}, "text": "Forest boundary protection Trained community members to monitor the forest reserve boundary and restore degraded areas with native species. Encroachment of cocoa farms into the forest reserve."}
{"key": "PRJ-C149AC9C8D", "metadata": {"account_sk": "SYN-42-05-PB", "country": "Côte d'Ivoire", "crop": "cocoa", "entity_type": "cooperative", "load_id": "ba46e96f6936", "name": "Cocoa pod husk composting", "org_name_fictional": "Coopérative La Source (fictional)", "primary_tag": "biodiversity_conservation", "region": "Goh-Djiboua", "start_year": 2023, "status": "completed", "text_sha1": "ecec3f1aed95282a2c04ddd45cfdd1a632f646ab"}, "text": "Cocoa pod husk composting Turned cocoa pod husks into compost instead of leaving them to rot, reducing black pod disease and improving soil. Black pod disease and poor soil fertility."}
{"key": "PRJ-8935B8635E", "metadata": {"account_sk": "SYN-42-06", "country": "Mexico", "crop": "coffee", "entity_type": "processing_operation", "load_id": "ba46e96f6936", "name": "Wet-mill wastewater treatment", "org_name_fictional": "Beneficio Agua Dulce (fictional)", "primary_tag": "biodiversity_conservation", "region": "Chiapas", "start_year": 2023, "status": "completed", "text_sha1": "d2687f2c203279acf8f61720b3dbf928d98f117f"}, "text": "Wet-mill wastewater treatment Built a treatment system for coffee wet-mill wastewater (aguas mieles) before discharge to the river. River contamination from processing wastewater."}
{"key": "PRJ-A6D53F2507", "metadata": {"account_sk": "SYN-42-06-PA", "country": "Mexico", "crop": "coffee", "entity_type": "processing_operation", "load_id": "ba46e96f6936", "name": "Water recirculation in pulping", "org_name_fictional": "Beneficio Buena Vista (fictional)", "primary_tag": "water", "region": "Chiapas", "start_year": 2023, "status": "completed", "text_sha1": "7c2534e5785a400ab83ea0fb144271237575ce73"}, "text": "Water recirculation in pulping Installed water recirculation in the pulping line to cut water use per kilo of coffee processed. Water scarcity at the mill during the dry season."}
{"key": "PRJ-23F19F3C18", "metadata": {"account_sk": "SYN-42-06-PB", "country": "Mexico", "crop": "coffee", "entity_type": "cooperative", "load_id": "ba46e96f6936", "name": "Coffee pulp composting", "org_name_fictional": "Cooperativa Los Andes (fictional)", "primary_tag": "biodiversity_conservation", "region": "Chiapas", "start_year": 2023, "status": "completed", "text_sha1": "050aa829f0c23716dc38095153d41b7c5299a1b9"}, "text": "Coffee pulp composting Composted coffee pulp from the mill and returned it to member farms as fertilizer. Pulp piles polluting nearby streams."}
